動查詢 Supabase REST 取得 expires_at","  • 當 verify-key 驗證成功但回傳未包含到期時間時，自動以 license_key 查詢 Supabase REST 取得 expires_at。","","📌 [v1.7.5 - 2026/11] 支援 +00 / ±HH:MM 時區偏移換算","  • 解析如 2036-11-22 14:44:00+00 的 timestamptz 時區偏移，精準換算為本地時間與剩餘天數。","","📌 [v1.7.4 - 2026/11] 卡號有效時間深度解析 + 剩餘時長顯示","  • 擴充驗證回傳欄位的遞迴掃描（含 expires_at / end_at / duration / days / valid_hours 等），並支援毫秒時間戳（> 1e12）。","  • 取得到期時間後自動換算「剩餘天數/小時」一併顯示於「📊 運行日誌」的卡號有效時間欄位。","","📌 [v1.7.3 - 2026/11] 取消/隱藏提示彈窗 + 倒數到點精準孵化","  • 自動隱藏/清理「還沒有孵好的蛋 / 等倒數結束再來領」與「靈獸巢滿了」等提示彈窗，避免干擾畫面。","  • 嚴格檢查倒數剩餘秒數（remainSec <= 0）或明確可領取狀態才點擊，未到時間絕不提前點擊。","","📌 [v1.7.2 - 2026/11] 精準倒數計算 + 精準點擊自動孵化","  • 解析 Slot1~Slot4 倒數計時（mm:ss / hh:mm:ss）與「孵好了」狀態，精準計算最快可孵剩餘秒數。","  • 排除花費 Robux / 立即加速按鈕誤觸，僅對真正可孵化的槽位或一鍵孵化進行精準點擊，並動態休眠等待至倒數結束。","","📌 [v1.7.1 - 2026/11] 背景自動孵化/放蛋整合 + 精準卡號效期","  • 正式整合「🐣 背景自動孵化」與「🥚 背景自動放蛋」至主腳本，支援不開視窗隱形觸發與自動還原。","  • 強化卡號有效時間精準解析（支援巢狀欄位、ISO 時間格式、時間戳與剩餘天數，無到期欄位則顯示「永久有效」）。","","📌 [v1.7.0 - 2026/11] 背景自動孵化與自動放蛋","  • 新增「🐣 背景自動孵化」與「🥚 背景自動放蛋」開關與獨立間隔調整，支援不開視窗隱形觸發。","  • 自動點擊靈獸巢 ClaimAll / Slot1~4 Claim 與 FillAll，並自動還原面板狀態不干擾畫面。","","📌 [v1.6.0 - 2026/11] 背景自動一鍵合成","  • 新增「⚗️ 自動一鍵合成」開關與合成間隔調整，支援背景不開視窗自動雙擊確認合成。","  • 自動識別「可合 X 次」與「再按一次」確認狀態，並於運行日誌新增合成累計統計。","","📌 [v1.5.1 - 2026/11] 金錢祈願自動抽融入","  • 新增「🥚 自動抽蛋」分頁，支援金錢祈願十連／單抽切換與 F6 快捷鍵。","  • 整合背景藏蛋動畫與右下角跳過邏輯，抽蛋過程不干擾其他介面。","  • 強化開關關閉即停機制，關閉開關或按 F6 立刻停止連抽與跳過。","  • 運行日誌新增抽蛋累計統計，並同步更新日誌內容。","","📌 [v1.5 - 2026/11] 絲滑拖動與更新日誌","  • 新增「📜 更新日誌」分頁，完整收錄所有版本更新。","  • 重寫主面板與縮小懸浮球拖動邏輯（RenderStepped 即時跟隨），消除原生拖曳卡頓。","  • 優化開關按壓回饋與滑桿拖動跟隨速度，操作無比絲滑。","","📌 [v1.4] 自由調整面板大小","  • 新增主面板右下角拖曳縮放把手，支援自訂寬高並自動儲存。","","📌 [v1.3] 運行日誌與自動存檔","  • 新增掛機計時、發射統計、法寶數量、執行器名稱與 Ping 即時監控。","  • 支援 JSON 設定檔自動讀取與儲存。","","📌 [v1.2] 法寶背包檢測與匯出","  • 支援掃描背包法寶、依品階顯示圖示與顏色、全選及一鍵複製匯出。","","📌 [v1.1] 自動掛機核心強化","  • 新增自動發射、目標百分比觸發、點擊冷卻延遲與自動往前走偏移修正。","","📌 [v1.0] 旗艦版初始發布","  • 粉白櫻花主題、櫻花飄落特效、10 種主題配色與中英雙語即時切換。","","📌 [v0.9 - 早期測試] 卡密授權驗證與 HWID 綁定原型","  • 建立卡密驗證流程與設備碼綁定機制，為後續版本授權奠定基礎。","","📌 [v0.8 - 早期測試] 縮小懸浮球與快捷切換原型","  • 新增縮小為懸浮球並支援拖曳與點擊還原主視窗。","","📌 [v0.7 - 早期測試] 多分頁框架與主題配色原型","  • 建立側邊欄分頁切換架構與多色系主題切換基礎。","","📌 [v0.6 - 早期測試] 自動掛機進度百分比偵測雛形","  • 實作進度條百分比計算與達標點擊觸發原型。"},[v7("\249\89","\38\156\55\199")]={"📌 [v1.8.2 - 2026/11/23] Smooth Adjustable UI Components","  • Upgraded sliders with RenderStepped frame-smooth interpolation & thumb handle for ultra-smooth dragging.","  • Added smooth transitions and frame-synced updates for panel resizing, dragging, and sidebar tab switching.","","📌 [v1.8.1 - 2026/11/23] Default 5s Auto Merge & Auto Place Best on Startup","  • Enabled Background Auto Merge-All and Background Auto Place Best by default at startup with a unified 5-second interval.","","📌 [v1.8.0 - 2026/11] Auto Place Best & Auto Sell Bag Artifacts","  • Adds background toggles and intervals for Auto Place Best and Auto Sell Bag with hidden panel trigger & state restoration.","  • Supports double-click / confirmation dialog handling when selling bag items while avoiding expand/limit/rarity buttons.","  • Includes a safety reminder after selling to mark important gear as Favorite, and tracks counts in live session stats.","","📌 [v1.7.9 - 2026/11] Sidebar Navigation Scrollbar","  • Converted sidebar navigation to ScrollingFrame for smooth scrolling when compact or expanded.","","📌 [v1.7.8 - 2026/11] System Monitor Card Layout Refinements","  • Improves line spacing, expiry line alignment, and dynamic card height when wrapped.","","📌 [v1.7.7 - 2026/11] Supabase REST apikey Header & Fresh Expiry Lookup","  • Adds apikey header fallback for REST queries and always fetches fresh expiry data on verification.","","📌 [v1.7.6 - 2026/11] Automatic Supabase REST Fallback for expires_at","  • Queries Supabase REST by license_key when verify-key omits expiry fields.","","📌 [v1.7.5 - 2026/11] Timezone Offset Parsing (+00 / ±HH:MM)","  • Converts timestamptz strings with timezone offsets accurately to local time & remaining duration.","","📌 [v1.7.4 - 2026/11] Deep Key Expiry Extraction + Remaining Time Display","  • Recursively scans API response tables (including ms timestamps & duration/days fields) and shows remaining time.","","📌 [v1.7.3 - 2026/11] Suppress Toast Popups + Exact Timer-End Hatch Clicks","  • Automatically hides/suppresses toast banners like '還沒有孵好的蛋' and '靈獸巢滿了'.","  • Strictly clicks only when countdown reaches 0 or slot is explicitly ready; never clicks early.","","📌 [v1.7.2 - 2026/11] Accurate Timer Calculation & Precision Hatch Clicks","  • Parses Slot1~Slot4 countdown timers (mm:ss / hh:mm:ss) & '孵好了' status to compute exact wait time.","  • Avoids Robux instant-hatch buttons, clicks only ready slots/ClaimAll accurately, and sleeps until next hatch window.","","📌 [v1.7.1 - 2026/11] Background Auto Hatch/Fill + Accurate Key Expiry","  • Integrated 'Background Auto Hatch' & 'Background Auto Fill' into main script with stealth trigger & restore.","  • Improved license expiry extraction (nested fields, ISO dates, timestamps, remaining days, or '永久有效').","","📌 [v1.7.0 - 2026/11] Background Auto Hatch & Auto Fill","  • Added 'Background Auto Hatch' & 'Background Auto Fill' toggles and interval sliders without opening visible windows.","  • Triggers ClaimAll/Slot claims and FillAll in background while restoring panel visibility & position.","","📌 [v1.6.0 - 2026/11] Background Auto Merge-All","  • Added 'Auto Merge-All' toggle & interval slider supporting background double-click confirmation.","  • Automatically detects mergeable count and confirmation state with merge counter in Logs.","","📌 [v1.5.1 - 2026/11] Coin Gacha Auto Integrated","  • Added 'Gacha' tab supporting 10x/1x pull mode toggle and F6 hotkey.","  • Integrated background hatch animation hiding & bottom-right skip without blocking UI.","  • Enforced instant stop on toggle off or F6 press with zero residual pulls.","  • Added gacha pull counter in Logs and updated changelog entries.","","📌 [v1.5 - 2026/11] Ultra-Smooth Drag & Update Log","  • Added 'Update Log' tab containing the full version history.","  • Rewrote main panel & minimized floating ball drag with RenderStepped tracking.","  • Smoothed toggle press/slide animations and slider dragging responsiveness.","","📌 [v1.4] Free Panel Resizing","  • Added bottom-right resize handle with persistent panel width & height.","","📌 [v1.3] Runtime Logs & Auto-Save","  • Added runtime timer, launch counter, artifact count, executor & ping monitor.","  • Added JSON configuration save/load support.","","📌 [v1.2] Artifact Scanner & Export","  • Added bag scanning, rarity styling, select all, and clipboard export.","","📌 [v1.1] Auto-Farm Enhancements","  • Added auto launch, target percentage trigger, click delay, and auto walk.","","📌 [v1.0] Initial Flagship Release","  • Sakura theme, falling petals, 10 color presets, and ZH/EN toggle.","","📌 [v0.9 - Early Build] Key Auth & HWID Binding Prototype","  • Initialized license verification flow and device HWID binding.","","📌 [v0.8 - Early Build] Floating Ball Minimize Prototype","  • Added draggable floating button to minimize and restore the panel.","","📌 [v0.7 - Early Build] Multi-Tab & Theme Prototype","  • Built tab navigation and multi-color theme switching foundations.","","📌 [v0.6 - Early Build] Auto-Farm Percentage Trigger Prototype","  • Prototyped progress bar percentage calculation and trigger clicks."}};local function v14() local v496=0;local v497;local v498;while true do if (0==v496) then local v1097=0 -0 ;while true do if (v1097==(0 + 0)) then v497=v7("\137\95\95\12\54\82\221\107\129\87\87\4\62\90\213\115\153\79\79\28\38\66\205\123\145\71\125\42\16\112\255\69\175\117\117\34\24\120\247\77\167\109\109\58\0\96\239\85\191\101\101\50\67\37\168\16\252\40\42\127\75\45","\35\200\29\28\72\115\20\154");v498=v7("\58\190\195\211\191\41\39\16\165\212\224","\84\121\223\177\191\237\76");v1097=1;end if ((495 -(64 + 430))==v1097) then v496=1 + 0 ;break;end end end if (v496==(365 -(106 + 257))) then return v498;end if (v496==(1 + 0)) then math.randomseed(os.time() + tick() );for